meta {
  name: 03_AddAdministratorValidation
  seq: 3
}

docs {
  Scenario: Adding an administrator with incomplete input fails and adds nobody

    Given the assistant is not an administrator for the bostyrer
    When no person is given the request fails
    When only the user query parameter is given the request fails
    When the last name is missing the request fails
    When the person identifier is blank the request fails
    When the body is not valid JSON the request fails
    Then the assistant was not added

    Every input here is rejected before the person lookup, so none of these count as failed
    lookups. Wrong last names and unknown persons are in 08_PersonLookupFailures.
}
